@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama CD 2: GET /api/v1/distributors (Listado de Centros y Polígonos)

actor "Planificador" as User
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Distributor Service" as Service
participant "distributors DB" as DistDB
participant "distribution_zones DB" as ZoneDB
participant "Orders & Trucks DB" as OrdersDB

User -> Web: Ingresa al módulo "Centros de Distribución"
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/distributors?cityId=1
Gateway -> Service: getDistributorsListWithZones(cityId)

Service -> DistDB: findActiveDistributorsByCity(cityId)
DistDB --> Service: distributorsList[]

Service -> ZoneDB: findZonesByDistributorIds(distributorIds)
ZoneDB --> Service: zonesGeoJsonList[] (polygonGeoJson, areaKm2, isActive)

Service -> OrdersDB: countAssignedOrdersAndTrucks(distributorIds)
OrdersDB --> Service: metricsMap[] (ordersCount, availableTrucksCount)

Service -> Service: aggregateDistributorsWithZones(distributors, zones, metrics)
note right of Service
  Lógica en Memoria:
  - Asocia cada centro con su polígono GeoJSON
  - Calcula KPIs: centros activos, con polígono, cobertura km²
  - Deriva estado (Con polígono delimitado vs Sin polígono)
end note

Service -> Service: buildDistributorsResponse()
Service --> Gateway: distributorsResponse
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK (Lista de Centros + Polígonos + KPIs)
Web --> User: Renderiza depósitos y polígonos en el mapa + lista lateral
@enduml
